RW/Falcon native-backed legacy aliases for GPT-QModel
Copyright 2026 ModelCloud.ai

The historical RW/Falcon architecture and checkpoint metadata were published
by the Technology Innovation Institute (TII). Those modeling sources credit
BigScience's BLOOM implementation as their starting point. The authoritative
Apache-2.0 release/relicensing revisions, inspected source and asset SHA-256
digests are recorded in source_sha256.json and README.md. No historical
checkpoint Python implementation or trained weights are redistributed here.

The runtime imports Transformers' Apache-2.0 Falcon implementation, whose
copyright notice credits the Falcon authors and HuggingFace Inc. team (2023).
LICENSE preserves the Apache-2.0 license shipped with Transformers 5.23.0.
ModelCloud adds config translation, definition ownership, a narrow eager
ALiBi bias correction, and regression/qualification tests. Native parameter
names, projections, decoder computation, caching and generation are reused.

Historical TII Falcon LLM royalty-license text must not be substituted for
the later Apache-2.0 release identified in the source manifest. The three
pinned README revisions explicitly state Apache-2.0 and remove that earlier
license. No assertion is made about uninspected Falcon releases or weights.
